", "call_id": "call_01a1459313b77cc3be87ca53", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 722641, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "call_01a145931d497140b8cdd4c4", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"base": "main", "body": "## Summary\n\nUpgrades `fastjson` in `requirements.txt` to **3.1.0** to fix **CVE-2026-31337** (high severity \u2014 unbounded recursion when parsing deeply nested arrays).\n\n## Details\n\n- fastjson 2.8.0 is affected by CVE-2026-31337 (affected: <2.9.4, >=3.0.0 <3.1.0).\n- Fixed releases: 2.9.4 and 3.1.0. Per team direction, we're already on the 3.x line, so we take the 3.1.0 fix.\n- CI passed on commit `13fee7191e`.", "head": "upgrade-fastjson-2.9.4", "reviewers": ["alex"], "title": "Upgrade fastjson to 3.1.0 to fix CVE-2026-31337"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 723541, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "call_01a145931d497140b8cdd4c4", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["attach_idempotency_key", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "rt-call_01a145931d497140b8cdd4c4", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 723541, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "call_01a145931d497140b8cdd4c4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 726747, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n- **Checked the advisory**: CVE-2026-31337 (high) \u2014 unbounded recursion when parsing deeply nested arrays in fastjson, affecting <2.9.4 and >=3.0.0 <3.1.0, fixed in **2.9.4** and **3.1.0**.\n- **Created branch** `upgrade-fastjson-2.9.4`.\n- First attempt to pin 2.9.4 was **denied by the human approver**, who noted the 3.x migration finished last sprint \u2014 so I pinned **fastjson==3.1.0** instead.\n- **CI passed** on the upgrade commit (`13fee7191e`, run `ci-0001`).\n- **Opened PR #101** against main with alex as the requested reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nThe PR is now awaiting review from alex; per policy it requires code-owner approval before merging into main.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Let me look up the advisory and the repo files.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14592aea37ce1a4eaa1d0", "function": {"arguments": "{\"id\":\"CVE-2026-31337\"}", "name": "get_advisory"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a14592aea37ce1a4eaa1ed", "function": {"arguments": "{}", "name": "list_files"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "The repo has requirements.txt. fastjson 2.8.0 \u2192 fixed in 2.9.4 (or 3.1.0). Upgrade to 2.9.4 (minor bump). Read requirements.txt.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14592c71b7640811ddb9c", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"requirements.txt\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "The advisory says fastjson <2.9.4 is affected, fixed in 2.9.4 (and 3.1.0). Staying on the 2.x line, I'll upgrade to 2.9.4.", "reasoning_content": "Fixed in 2.9.4 (staying on 2.x line). Update requirements.txt. Create branch, commit, CI, PR.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14592e0987430a273e052", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"upgrade-fastjson-2.9.4\"}", "name": "create_branch"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14592f07d764294408b03", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"upgrade-fastjson-2.9.4\",\"message\":\"Upgrade fastjson to 2.9.4 to fix CVE-2026-31337\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"requirements.txt\",\"con